cache (NMB_SHADER_MEMO_MB, NMB_SHADER_DISK_MB at cargo time; scripts/laurel/metal-env.sh sets them for the Mi A3).
Unset (negroni) = metal2vulkan's defaults (256 MiB memo per process, 25 GiB directory): no change there.

